<title>CANADA: Transat to sell 2.5 mln shrs or warrants.</title>
<headline>Transat to sell 2.5 mln shrs or warrants.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transat A.T. Inc said on Thursday it agreed for underwriters to buy and sell to the public 2.5 million common shares or special warrants for a purchase price of C$30.25 each.</p>
<p>Closing is expected by about November 7.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
